OL,3,GNEWSASchool put into special measures  
OL,4,Aby Ofsted                              
OL,6,FA secondary school has been placed in  
OL,7,Fspecial measures after an Ofsted       
OL,8,Finspection identified concerns about   
OL,9,Fsafeguarding, officials have said.     
OL,11,FMillais School in Horsham said it      
OL,12,Faccepted Ofsted's findings and was     
OL,13,Fcommitted to making the changes needed 
OL,14,Fto improve.                            
OL,16,FThe school's governing board has       
OL,17,Fresigned and been replaced by an       
OL,18,Finterim executive board (IEB).         
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
