OL,3,GNEWSASchool put into special measures  
OL,4,Aby Ofsted                              
OL,6,FIn a statement issued on behalf of the 
OL,7,FIEB, its chair Brian Pope said:        
OL,8,F"Everyone at the school is disappointed
OL,9,Fwith the outcome, but accepts Ofsted's 
OL,10,Ffindings."                             
